# Avatar portrait Base state

When the user asks to return avatar portraits to **Base state**, restore from:

- `loot&lasers/Scripts/_avatar_portrait_base_state/AvatarPortrait.gd.bak`
- `loot&lasers/Scripts/_avatar_portrait_base_state/AvatarRenderer.gd.bak`

Copy those over the live scripts (rename to `.gd`):

- `loot&lasers/Scripts/AvatarPortrait.gd`
- `loot&lasers/Scripts/AvatarRenderer.gd`

Base state was locked **2026-08-12** as the geometric procedural look before the smoothing / anti-overlap redesign. `.bak` files are ignored by Godot so they do not register duplicate `class_name`s.
